<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-024" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0000" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">崔𤣥伯</persName>清河東武城人也名犯<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0012" ref="8dc_745_f37">髙祖</persName>廟諱魏司空<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0019" ref="9g7_n2e_6ho">林</persName>六世孫也祖<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0025" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">悦</persName>仕<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0027" ref="u61_ylg_6av">石虎</persName>官至司徒左長史關内侯父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0040" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_A">潛</persName>仕<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0042" ref="796_d68_593">慕容暐</persName>為黄門侍郎竝有才學之稱<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0056" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>少有雋才號曰<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0064" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">冀州神童</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0068" ref="519_3e4_cc9">苻融</persName>牧冀州虚心禮敬拜<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0078" ref="519_3e4_cc9">陽平公</persName>侍郎領冀州從事管征東記室出總庶事入為賔友衆務修理處斷無滯<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0109" ref="1bd_b18_3c0">苻堅</persName>聞而竒之徵為太子舍人辭以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0123" ref="p8k_m4w_ryp">母</persName>疾不就左遷著作佐郎<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0133" ref="dae_1b4_abf">苻丕</persName>牧冀州為征東功曹太原<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0145" ref="z7j_9wi_nee">郝軒</persName>世名知人稱<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0152" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>有王佐之才近代所未有也<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0165" ref="1bd_b18_3c0">堅</persName>亡避難於齊魯之間為丁零<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0177" ref="ldv_q5b_zap">翟釗</persName>及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0180" ref="uke_dff_yrf">司馬昌明</persName>叛將<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0186" ref="390_440_dc9">張願</persName>所留縶<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0191" ref="z7j_9wi_nee">郝軒</persName>歎曰<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0195" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">斯人</persName>而遇斯時不因扶摇之勢而與鷃雀飛沉豈不惜哉<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0217" ref="t7y_8p2_aeb">慕容垂</persName>以為吏部郎尚書左丞髙陽内史所歴著稱立身雅正與世不羣雖在兵亂猶勵志篤學不以資産為意<rs id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p001:m0260" type="unresolved">妻子</rs>不免飢寒</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0000" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>征<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0003" ref="hx5_tf8_gft">慕容寳</persName>次於常山<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0010" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>棄郡東走海濵<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0018" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>素聞<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0022" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">其</persName>名遣騎追求執送於軍門引見與語恱之以為黄門侍郎與<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p002:m0046" ref="9gc_00a_mwa">張衮</persName>對總機要草創制度</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">時<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0001" ref="s6y_280_81r">司馬徳宗</persName>遣使來朝<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0009" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>將報之詔有司博議國號<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0021" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>議曰<rs id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0025" type="unresolved">三皇五帝</rs>之立號也或因所生之土或即封國之名故虞夏商周始皆諸侯及聖徳既隆萬國宗戴稱號隨本不復更立唯商人屢徙改號曰殷然猶兼行不廢始基之稱故詩云殷商之旅又云天命𤣥鳥降而生商宅殷土茫茫此其義也昔<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0117" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_A">漢髙祖</persName>以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0121" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_A">漢王</persName>定三秦滅彊楚故遂以漢為號國家雖統北方廣漠之土逮于<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0147" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">陛下</persName>應運龍飛雖曰舊邦受命惟新是以登極之初改代曰魏又<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0172" ref="gyg_hql_qdj">慕容永</persName>亦奉進魏土夫魏者大名神州之上國斯乃革命之徵驗利見之𤣥符也<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0203" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">臣</persName>愚以為宜號為魏<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p003:m0211" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>從之於是四方賔王之貢咸稱大魏矣</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0000" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>幸鄴歴問故事於<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0009" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>應對若流<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0015" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>善之及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0020" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">車駕</persName>還京師次於恒嶺<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0029" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>親登山頂撫慰新民適遇<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0041" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>扶<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0044" ref="p8k_m4w_ryp">老母</persName>登嶺<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0048" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>嘉之賜以牛米因詔諸徙人不能自進者給以車牛遷吏部尚書命有司制官爵撰朝儀協音樂定律令申科禁<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p004:m0093" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>總而裁之以為永式</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">及置八部大夫以擬八坐<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0010" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>通署三十六曹如令僕統事深為<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0025" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>所任勢傾朝廷而儉約自居不營産業家徒四壁出無車乗朝晡步上<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0054" ref="p8k_m4w_ryp">母</persName>年七十供養無重膳<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0063" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>嘗使人密察聞而益重之厚加饋賜時人亦或譏其過約而<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0088" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>為之踰甚<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0094" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>常引問古今舊事王者制度治世之則<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0111" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>陳古人制作之體及明君賢臣往代廢興之由甚合<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0133" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">上</persName>意未嘗謇諤忤㫖亦不諂諛茍容及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0148" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>季年大臣多犯威怒<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p005:m0158" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>獨無譴者由於此也</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0000" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>曾引<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0004" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>講漢書至<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0010" ref="e5s_bwt_y45">婁敬</persName>說<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0013" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_A">漢祖</persName>欲以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0017" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_AI">魯元公主</persName>妻匈奴善之嗟歎者良久是以<rs id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0033" type="unresolved">諸公主</rs>皆釐降于賔附之國朝臣子弟雖名族美彦不得尚焉尚書職罷賜<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0062" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>爵白馬侯加周兵將軍與舊功臣<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0077" ref="viu_0vl_qwx">庾岳</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p006:m0079" ref="ub4_k5o_w3c">奚斤</persName>等同班而信寵過之</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0000" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>崩<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0003" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>未即位<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0008" ref="2zl_raa_zz4">清河王紹</persName>聞人心不安大出財帛班賜朝士<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0025" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>獨不受<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0030" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>即位命<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0035" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>居門下虚已訪問以不受<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0047" ref="2zl_raa_zz4">紹</persName>財帛特賜帛二百匹<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p007:m0056" ref="ee5_8b3_d2c">長孫嵩</persName>已下咸愧焉</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">詔遣使者廵行郡國糾察守宰不如法者令<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0017" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>與<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0020" ref="huz_6kq_q3r">宜都公穆觀</persName>等按之<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0028" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>稱<rs id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0031" type="unresolved">其</rs>平當又詔<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0036" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>與<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p008:m0039" ref="ee5_8b3_d2c">長孫嵩</persName>等坐朝堂决刑獄</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0000" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>以郡國豪右大為民蠧乃優詔徵之民多戀本而長吏逼遣於是輕薄少年因相扇動所在聚結西河建興盗賊竝起守宰討之不能禁<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0054" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>乃引<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0058" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0061" ref="17x_i5c_tgj">北新侯安同</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0066" ref="pvb_lu3_y2k">夀光侯叔孫建</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0072" ref="r4a_ewe_13s">元城侯元屈</persName>等問曰前以兇俠亂民故徵之京師而守宰失於綏撫令有逃竄今犯者已多不可悉誅<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0111" ref="19f_55e_8b2">朕</persName>欲大赦以紓之卿等以為何如<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0124" ref="r4a_ewe_13s">屈</persName>對曰民逃不罪而反赦之似若有求於下不如先誅首惡赦其黨類<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0151" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>曰王者治天下以安民為本何能顧小曲直也譬琴瑟不調必改而更張法度不平亦須蕩而更制夫赦雖非正道而可以權行自秦漢以來莫不相踵<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0211" ref="r4a_ewe_13s">屈</persName>言先誅後赦會於不能兩去孰與一行便定若其赦而不改者誅之不晚<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p009:m0240" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>從之</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">神瑞初詔<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0004" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">元伯</persName>與<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0007" ref="ee5_8b3_d2c">南平公嵩</persName>等坐止車門右聴理萬幾事并州胡數萬家南掠河内遣將軍<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0035" ref="dps_jq6_hke">公孫表</persName>等率師討之敗績<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0045" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>問羣臣曰胡冦縱暴人衆不少<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0059" ref="dps_jq6_hke">表</persName>等已不能制若不早誅則良民大受其禍今既盛秋不可為此小盗而復興衆以廢民業將若之何<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0098" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>對曰<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0102" ref="dps_jq6_hke">表</persName>等諸軍不為不足但失於處分故使小盗假息耳胡衆雖盛而無猛健主將所謂千奴共一膽也宜得大將軍為胡所服信者將數百騎就攝<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0157" ref="dps_jq6_hke">表</persName>軍以討之賊聞之必望風震怖<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0170" ref="pvb_lu3_y2k">夀光侯建</persName>前在并州號為威猛胡醜畏服諸將莫及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p010:m0190" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>從之遂平胡冦尋拜天部大人進爵為公</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">泰常三年夏<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0005" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>病篤<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0009" ref="19f_55e_8b2">太宗</persName>遣<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0012" ref="huz_6kq_q3r">侍中宜都公穆觀</persName>就受遺言更遣侍臣問疾一夜數返及卒下詔痛惜贈司空諡<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0043" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">文貞公</persName>䘮禮一依<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0050" ref="cvn_bxy_o4a">安城王叔孫俊</persName>故事詔羣臣及附國渠帥皆㑹葬自親王以外盡令拜送太和中<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0081" ref="8dc_745_f37">髙祖</persName>追録先朝功臣以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p011:m0090" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>配饗廟庭</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0000" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>自非朝廷文誥四方書檄初不染翰故世無遺文尤善草𨽻行押之書為世摹楷<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0033" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>祖<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0036" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">恱</persName>與范陽<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0040" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">盧諶</persName>竝以博藝著名<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0048" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>法<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0050" ref="9hu_q3h_aug">鍾繇</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0052" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">恱</persName>法<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0054" ref="67b_2b2_4b8">衛瓘</persName>而俱習<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0059" ref="i3g_0wt_qmx">索靖</persName>之草皆盡其妙<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0067" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>𫝊子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0070" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAA">偃</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0071" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAA">偃</persName>𫝊子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0074" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBAAA">邈</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0075" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v">悦</persName>𫝊子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0078" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_A">潛</persName><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0079" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_A">潛</persName>𫝊<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0081" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>世不替業故魏初重崔盧之書又<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0096" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>之行押特盡精巧而不見遺迹子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p012:m0111" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAB">浩</persName>襲爵别有𫝊</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p013" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">次子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p013:m0002" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAA">簡</persName>字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p013:m0004" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAA">沖亮</persName>一名<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p013:m0008" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAA">覽</persName>好學少以善書知名<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p013:m0017" ref="dq9_xzy_xol">太祖</persName>初歴位中書侍郎征虜將軍爵五等侯參著作事卒</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014:m0000" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAA">簡</persName>弟<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014:m0002" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAC">恬</persName>字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014:m0004" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAC">叔元</persName>小名<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014:m0008" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAC">白</persName>歴給事中賜爵繹幕子出為上黨太守平南將軍豫州刺史進爵陽武侯坐<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p014:m0038" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAB">浩</persName>伏誅</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">始<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0001" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">𤣥伯</persName>因<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0004" ref="1bd_b18_3c0">苻堅</persName>亂欲避地江南於泰山為<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0016" ref="390_440_dc9">張願</persName>所獲本圖不遂乃作詩以自傷而不行於時蓋懼罪也及<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0040" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAB">浩</persName>誅中書侍郎<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0046" ref="0f1_viy_h1v">髙允</persName>受𠡠收<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0051" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAB">浩</persName>家始見此詩<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0057" ref="0f1_viy_h1v">允</persName>知<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0059" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">其</persName>意<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0061" ref="0f1_viy_h1v">允</persName>孫<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0063" ref="p06_4l2_vmx">綽</persName>録於<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0066" ref="0f1_viy_h1v">允</persName>集始<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0069" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">元伯</persName>父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0072" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_A">潛</persName>為兄<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0075" ref="p9u_d7n_3wh">渾</persName>誅手筆草本延昌初著作佐郎<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0088" ref="7ad_718_47c_AAA">王遵業</persName>買書於市而遇得之計誅至今將二百載寶其書迹深藏祕之武定中<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0118" ref="7ad_718_47c_AAA">遵業</persName>子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0121" ref="7ad_718_47c_AAAA">松年</persName>以遺黄門郎<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0128" ref="b1x_1ns_pi5">崔季舒</persName>人多摹搨之左光禄大夫<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0141" ref="v9c_8z4_uv7">姚元標</persName>以工書知名於時見<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0152" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_A">潛</persName>書謂為過於<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p015:m0158" ref="v9c_8z4_uv7">已</persName>也</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0000" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AA">元伯</persName>弟<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0003" ref="xb3_qm5_kf6">徽</persName>字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0005" ref="xb3_qm5_kf6">元猷</persName>少有文才與渤海<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0014" ref="0ao_ait_sas">髙演</persName>俱知名初徵相州别駕中書侍郎稍遷祕書監賜爵貝邱侯加龍驤將軍<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0044" ref="a85_0fe_9fa">樂安王範</persName>鎮長安<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0051" ref="d10_1e6_850">世祖</persName>以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0054" ref="a85_0fe_9fa">範</persName>年少而三秦民夷恃險多變乃選忠清舊徳之士與<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0075" ref="a85_0fe_9fa">範</persName>俱鎮以<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0079" ref="xb3_qm5_kf6">徽</persName>為散騎常侍督雍涇梁秦四州諸軍事平西將軍副將行樂安王傅進爵濟南公<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0111" ref="xb3_qm5_kf6">徽</persName>為政務存大體不親小事性好人倫引接賔客或談及平生或講論道義誨誘後進終日不止以疾徵還京師真君四年卒諡曰<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-024-cuixuanbo:p016:m0161" ref="xb3_qm5_kf6">元公</persName>士類無不歎惜</p>
</text>
